            <div xml:id="d318">

                <pb facs="0448" n="360" xml:id="pg360"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">837.00/3653a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in Cuba</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Welles</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-08-12T20:00:00-04:00">August 12, 1933—8
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>73. From Caffery. The President and Secretary have asked me to express their warm
                    congratulations to you and their appreciation of what you have done.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
